\v 13 \add So one\add* day¦232483 when \add Iyyov's\add* sons¦232484 and his daughters¦232485 were¦232486 eating¦232486 and drinking¦232487 wine¦232488 in¦232489 their¦232490 eldest brother's¦232490 house¦232489,
