\v 16 \add While\add* he was still speaking¦232529, another \add messenger\add* came¦232531 and said¦232532, “The¦232533 fire¦232533 of¦232533 God¦232534 fell¦232535 from¦232536 the sky and burnt¦232539 up the sheep¦232540 and the \add shepherds\add*. \add Only ashes are left\add*, except that¦232528 I¦232543 alone¦232547 escaped¦232543 to tell you.”
