\v 7 So¦232793 the adversary¦232788 went¦232787 away from Yahweh's¦232791 \add presence\add*, and¦232787 he¦232792 \add infected\add* Iyyov¦232795 with¦232796 bad¦232797 boils from the sole¦232798 of his foot¦232799 to \add the top of his head\add*.
\v 8 \add Iyyov picked up a piece of broken pottery\add* to \add scratch\add* himself¦232808 with \add as\add* he¦232810 sat¦232811 \add down\add* in¦232812 the middle¦232812 of a pile of ashes¦232814.
