\v 10 “You're talking¦232831 like a foolish¦232830 \add person\add*,” Iyyov \add ≈replied¦232826\add*. “Should we¦232836 \add only\add* accept¦232836 good¦232835 from¦232837 God¦232838 and¦232826 not receive the bad?” In¦232844 all¦232844 of that¦232846, Iyyov didn't¦232842 sin¦232849 \add in what he said\add*.
